      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "You can use a cosmogram or star chart as an optional focus component for augury. When you do, the augury can account for consequences up to 1 hour into the future, and your chance of a successful reading increases by 4%. If you also consult a calculating standard orrery or calculating grand orrery, the augury can see up to 1 day into the future and your chance of success increases by 8%."
      }
